<title>UK: Late July wet Brent trades Aug -5 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Late July wet Brent trades Aug -5 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent blend crude loading July 27-29 changed hands on Friday at a five cent discount to August Brent, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo's value is 10 cents under the level agreed on Thursday for another Brent loading the same dates.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
